+		//                       (int)Bounds.OuterWidth, (int)Bounds.OuterHeight)
+		// where the last two arguments are the *absolute* right/bottom edge of
+		// the region to blur. Neither SurfaceTransformBlur.BlurPartial nor
+		// GaussianBlur.boxBlur{H,T}_4RGBPartial clamps them against the
+		// surface: the inner loops write destP[y * w + x] straight through raw
+		// int* for x in [xs, xe). The composer's Cairo surface is allocated
+		// from GuiComposer.Bounds.OuterWidth in GuiComposer.Compose(), so any
